#: ../../entities/university-polytechnic.rst:1
msgid "Shanghai Polytechnic University"
msgstr "上海第二工业大学"

#: ../../entities/university-polytechnic.rst:4
msgid "上海第二工业大学"
msgstr "上海第二工业大学"

#: ../../entities/university-polytechnic.rst:6
msgid "University | Pudong | Research checked 2026-11-04"
msgstr "高校｜浦东新区｜研究核对日期 2026-11-04"

#: ../../entities/university-polytechnic.rst:8
msgid "Ministry of Education institution code: 4131012044."
msgstr "教育部学校标识码：4131012044。"

#: ../../entities/university-polytechnic.rst:10
msgid ""
"Institutional entry in the June 2026 Ministry of Education register. "
"Suggested collaboration themes: Applied engineering, electronics, "
"manufacturing. These themes are editorial routing guidance, not a "
"verified offer of laboratory access or startup funding."
msgstr "列入教育部2026年6月高校名录。建议合作主题：应用工程、电子、制造。这些主题为编辑对接建议，并非已经核实的实验室准入或创业资助承诺。"

#: ../../entities/university-polytechnic.rst:12
msgid ""
"`Evidence S076 "
"<https://www.moe.gov.cn/jyb_xxgk/s5743/s5744/202606/t20260618_1441074.html>`_. "
"全国高等学校名单 - 中华人民共和国教育部政府门户网站."
msgstr "`证据 S076 <https://www.moe.gov.cn/jyb_xxgk/s5743/s5744/202606/t20260618_1441074.html>`_. 全国高等学校名单 - 中华人民共和国教育部政府门户网站."

#: ../../entities/university-polytechnic.rst:14
msgid "Status and support"
msgstr "状态与支持"

#: ../../entities/university-polytechnic.rst:17
msgid "Published entity; intake to confirm"
msgstr "机构有来源，招募待确认"

#: ../../entities/university-polytechnic.rst:19
msgid ""
"No standard cash award, fee waiver or equity percentage is verified for "
"this entry. Request the current written offer."
msgstr "本条未核实统一现金资助、免费权益或股权比例，请索取现行书面方案。"

#: ../../entities/university-polytechnic.rst:21
msgid "Contact and location"
msgstr "联系与位置"

#: ../../entities/university-polytechnic.rst:24
msgid ""
"Official university website; request the technology-transfer, research "
"cooperation or entrepreneurship office"
msgstr "通过高校官网咨询技术转移、科研合作或创业部门"

#: ../../entities/university-polytechnic.rst:26
msgid "`Official website / intake route <https://www.sspu.edu.cn/>`_"
msgstr "`官网／对接入口 <https://www.sspu.edu.cn/>`_"

#: ../../entities/university-polytechnic.rst:28
msgid ""
"A direct program phone or email is not verified here. Use the official "
"route and request the responsible team; no contact has been invented."
msgstr "本版未核实项目直线电话或邮箱。请通过官方渠道索取负责团队，本图谱不编造联系人。"

#: ../../entities/university-polytechnic.rst:30
msgid ""
"Map position uses a district or campus anchor; it is not a verified "
"office location."
msgstr "地图位置使用区级或校区锚点，并非核实后的办公室位置。"

#: ../../entities/university-polytechnic.rst:32
msgid "Application workflow"
msgstr "申请流程"

#: ../../entities/university-polytechnic.rst:35
msgid ""
"Editorial application checklist. The current official notice or agreement "
"controls the actual procedure."
msgstr "编辑申请清单，实际流程以现行官方通知或协议为准。"

#: ../../entities/university-polytechnic.rst:37
msgid ""
"Find the relevant research group and state the scientific or industrial "
"problem."
msgstr "匹配科研团队，明确科学或产业问题。"

#: ../../entities/university-polytechnic.rst:39
msgid ""
"Send a short proposal covering data, equipment, outputs, funding and "
"timescale."
msgstr "发送涵盖数据、设备、成果、经费及时程的简短方案。"

#: ../../entities/university-polytechnic.rst:41
msgid ""
"Agree the collaboration route, publication, IP and institutional "
"authorization."
msgstr "约定合作路径、发表、知识产权及单位授权。"

#: ../../entities/university-polytechnic.rst:43
msgid "Obtain written access or project approval before beginning the work."
msgstr "开始工作前取得书面准入或项目批准。"

#: ../../entities/university-polytechnic.rst:45
msgid ""
"Confirm whether external founders can apply, whether student or alumni "
"status is required, who owns the research IP, and whether support is a "
"service, a loan, a grant or equity. The thematic match in this profile is "
"editorial guidance."
msgstr "确认外部创业者能否申请、是否要求在校或校友身份、科研知识产权权属，以及支持属于服务、贷款、补助还是股权。本档案的主题匹配为编辑建议。"

#: ../../entities/university-polytechnic.rst:47
msgid ":doc:`Pudong district route </districts/pudong>`"
msgstr ":doc:`浦东新区对接路径 </districts/pudong>`"
